    "introduction": "This guide will show you how to replace the bobbins in the Brother CS6000i sewing machine. You won't need any tools for this replacement, and it only takes approximately 5 minutes.",
    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Plastic Sewing Bobbins",
            "text": "Remove the grey plastic needle plate.\nPlace the bobbin inside the bobbin case.",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/KUEnsuxDMtIUYYXf.medium",
            "image_links": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/KUEnsuxDMtIUYYXf.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/UrRPJVcWfHrXVCYk.200x150"
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/179997/384330",
            "comment_links": [],
            "additional_images": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/UrRPJVcWfHrXVCYk.medium"
            ]
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Replace bobbins on the two bobbin holders on the top right of the device",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/Sa1UBbNhB1TlNFxv.medium",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/179997/384580",
            "comment_links": []
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": {
        "text": "To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.",
